      "Normal cerebrospinal fluid analysis",
      "Electromyography showing incremental response on repetitive nerve stimulation"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "Usually normal brain MRI to exclude other causes of hypotonia"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "No known genetic mutations associated"
    ],
